  "sentences": [
    {
      "act": 1,
      "line": "A1-01",
      "sentence": "One word I would use to describe myself is cosmopolitan—which in Greek means a citizen of the world.",
      "start": 0.5045871559633027,
      "end": 7.000955657492354,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 1,
      "line": "A1-02",
      "sentence": "Hi, I’m Alexander Leiar, a third-year business student at the University of Arizona’s Eller College of Management.",
      "start": 7.312882262996941,
      "end": 14.758944954128436,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 1,
      "line": "A1-02",
      "sentence": "For leaders in commercial real estate and entrepreneurship, I bring an international perspective, the ability to adapt, and a genuine interest in building relationships.",
      "start": 14.979128440366967,
      "end": 25.44067278287461,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 1,
      "line": "A1-03",
      "sentence": "My story is a little different from most.",
      "start": 25.752599388379195,
      "end": 28.073585626911306,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 1,
      "line": "A1-03",
      "sentence": "I was born in Portugal and grew up in South Africa, where I was exposed to different cultures, people, and ways of life from an early age.",
      "start": 28.29376911314984,
      "end": 36.982492354740046,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 1,
      "line": "A1-03",
      "sentence": "That experience taught me to stay open-minded and make the most of new situations.",
      "start": 37.202675840978586,
      "end": 42.21597859327216,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 2,
      "line": "A2-01",
      "sentence": "Growing up, sports were a big part of my life.",
      "start": 42.89487767584097,
      "end": 45.65007645259938,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 2,
      "line": "A2-01",
      "sentence": "I played rugby and water polo and swam competitively.",
      "start": 45.87025993883791,
      "end": 49.255542813455655,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 2,
      "line": "A2-01",
      "sentence": "Those experiences taught me discipline, resilience, and how to perform both as part of a team and on my own.",
      "start": 49.47572629969419,
      "end": 56.21139143730887,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 2,
      "line": "A2-02",
      "sentence": "Traveling across Africa, Europe, and Asia also pushed me outside my comfort zone.",
      "start": 56.52331804281346,
      "end": 61.856460244648325,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 2,
      "line": "A2-02",
      "sentence": "Each place introduced me to new perspectives and helped me become more comfortable connecting with people from different backgrounds.",
      "start": 62.07664373088685,
      "end": 68.90565749235473,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 3,
      "line": "A3-01",
      "sentence": "That adaptability has carried into my professional experiences.",
      "start": 69.58455657492355,
      "end": 73.35022935779817,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 3,
      "line": "A3-01",
      "sentence": "At Fine & Rare Wines in South Africa, I gained exposure to supply chain operations and client service.",
      "start": 73.57041284403671,
      "end": 80.31349388379205,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 3,
      "line": "A3-01",
      "sentence": "At DM Financial in Ireland, I worked with financial statements, helped with payroll and supported the management accounts team.",
      "start": 80.53367737003059,
      "end": 88.49785932721713,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 3,
      "line": "A3-02",
      "sentence": "Most recently, at Abstrakt Marketing Group in Saint Louis, I stepped into a fast-paced sales environment and connected with business leaders to identify opportunities.",
      "start": 88.80978593272172,
      "end": 98.95730122324159,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 3,
      "line": "A3-02",
      "sentence": "There, I generated 10 qualified appointments representing roughly two hundred and fifty thousand dollars in potential pipeline revenue.",
      "start": 99.17748470948011,
      "end": 106.9992354740061,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 3,
      "line": "A3-03",
      "sentence": "Each experience challenged me in a different way, but all three taught me the importance of getting comfortable being uncomfortable, building trust, and being willing to learn.",
      "start": 107.3111620795107,
      "end": 117.24606269113148,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 4,
      "line": "A4-01",
      "sentence": "Today, I bring those lessons with me to Eller and to the Arizona water polo team.",
      "start": 117.92496177370029,
      "end": 123.04128440366972,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 4,
      "line": "A4-01",
      "sentence": "Balancing academics, athletics, and professional opportunities has strengthened my time management and commitment to the people who count on me.",
      "start": 123.26146788990826,
      "end": 131.96467889908257,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 4,
      "line": "A4-02",
      "sentence": "For a real estate team or growing business, I bring a willingness to learn, a perspective shaped by international experiences, and the communication skills to connect with different people.",
      "start": 132.27660550458717,
      "end": 143.493501529052,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 4,
      "line": "A4-02",
      "sentence": "I’m excited by opportunities where I can help build relationships, solve problems, and contribute to a team.",
      "start": 143.71368501529054,
      "end": 150.2645259938838,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 5,
      "line": "A5-01",
      "sentence": "Looking ahead, I want to learn from experienced professionals, explore commercial real estate, and eventually start a business of my own.",
      "start": 150.94342507645263,
      "end": 159.44071100917435,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 5,
      "line": "A5-02",
      "sentence": "If you’re looking for someone who is curious, adaptable, and ready to contribute, I’d love to connect through LinkedIn or email.",
      "start": 159.75263761467892,
      "end": 167.20309633027526,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    },
    {
      "act": 5,
      "line": "A5-02",
      "sentence": "Thank you for taking the time to learn a little about me.",
      "start": 167.4232798165138,
      "end": 170.21831039755355,
      "voice": "am_michael"
    }
  ],
